WEBVTT

00:14:59.985 --> 00:15:04.230
You didn't need my judgment and my contempt.

00:15:04.230 --> 00:15:08.728
You needed my empathy and compassion,

00:15:08.728 --> 00:15:10.723
and above all else, you needed a doctor

00:15:10.723 --> 00:15:13.352
who was willing to consider

00:15:13.352 --> 00:15:16.416
maybe you didn't let the system down.

00:15:16.416 --> 00:15:19.634
Maybe the system, of which I was a part,

00:15:19.634 --> 00:15:22.073
was letting you down.

00:15:22.073 --> 00:15:24.874
If you're watching this now,

00:15:24.874 --> 00:15:29.112
I hope you can forgive me.

00:15:29.112 --> 00:15:33.112
(Applause)